WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.996
Text cleaning is a pipeline not one magic function
First inspect

00:00:06.022 --> 00:00:12.995
the raw value Then normalize only known formatting
noise If

00:00:13.008 --> 00:00:19.085
the string contains meaningful structure parse the
pieces you need Validation

00:00:19.111 --> 00:00:25.658
is a separate step that asks whether the cleaned
value follows an expected rule Finally

00:00:25.882 --> 00:00:31.636
use the cleaned field for analysis or reporting When
traceability matters

00:00:31.859 --> 00:00:33.965
preserve the raw source value as well
